 of the pop culture all conversation  again  absolutely when you have a concept that  is that intriguing and also has such  opportunity for growth especially in the  time period and the kind of audience  that you're going for  whyever stop especially if you could put  your own spin on it and this is  definitely something I've never seen  anything quite like it before so Jeff  huge  gratulations to you and the team thank  you for being here today thank you for  having me I'm very excited and thanks  for watching moving of course guys keep  an eye out for Fantasy Island check it  out in theaters hits theaters  valentine's day please do not leave this  interview without liking and sharing it  you know where you should go after you  see this interview maybe our interview  with the cast or have got a brand new  episode of hocus-pocus all up and  running on the collider video and  collider interview channel we will see  you soon with more collateral
 

